    "transfer": "Write a=mu*b with nonnegative smooth b and sum b(d)/d^(5/8) finite. For d<=Y^(1/8) the relevant prime-free Mobius interval has exponent at least 5/7+o(1). Larger divisors cost O(h Y^(-3/64)+Y^(5/8))."
