  "paper_scope": "Whole-block complement has leading coefficient -9. Every sufficiently late block admits a true signed allocation to q and 5q. The spent cost at any moving head is O_B(sqrt(T)/log^B(2T)) for any fixed B. A sparse counterexample demonstrates that smallness, capacity, signs and support alone do not imply the remaining fourth-power lower bound.",
